    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Uncommon (Requires Attunement)</em></p><p>This cap has 3 charges and regains all expended charges daily at dawn. While wearing it, you can take a Magic action and expend 1 charge to give yourself the &amp;Reference[Invisible apply=false] condition for 10 minutes. The effect ends early if the cap is removed, or right after you make an attack roll, deal damage, or cast a spell.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-DP1P3zrkyXAJ81jj\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>L’effet <em>Invisible</em> dure 10 minutes : retirez-le dès que vous attaquez, infligez des dégâts ou lancez un sort.</p></section>",
